# Script PDFs — large scans, and some are copyrighted (e.g. the Jon Jory
# Pride & Prejudice adaptation). Kept on local disk for OCR work, not committed.
# Public-domain test-set sources to re-download: docs/ocr-test-set.md
sample-scripts/*.pdf
sample-scripts/ocr-test-set/
